+[28C[4A]0;⠂ Claude Code[28D[4B[5A[48;5;237m[38;5;239m❯ [38;5;231m# Constraint-Based Event Scheduler[39m                                                                                                                                                                                        [1B                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [1B  [38;5;231mBuild a constraint-based event scheduler that assigns events to rooms within a time window, respecting capacity limits, prerequisite ordering, and room preferences.[39m                                                      [1B                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [1B  [38;5;231m## Data Model[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                             [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m### Event[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                 [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m```typescript[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                             [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231minterface Event {[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                         [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m  id: string;[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                             [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m  name: string;[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                           [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m  duration: number;       // in minutes[39m                                                                                                                                                                                   [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m  attendees?: number;     // number of people attending (default: 1)[39m                                                                                                                                                      [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m  prerequisites?: string[]; // event IDs that must finish before this starts[39m                                                                                                                                              [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m  preferredRoom?: string; // room ID preference (hint, not hard constraint)[39m                                                                                                                                               [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m}[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                         [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m```[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                       [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m### Room[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                  [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m```typescript[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                             [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231minterface Room {[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                          [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m  id: string;[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                             [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m  name: string;[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                           [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m  capacity: number;       // max attendees[39m                                                                                                                                                                                [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m}[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                         [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m```[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                       [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m### Schedule Options[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                      [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m```typescript[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                             [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231minterface ScheduleOptions {[39m                                                                                                                                                                                               [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m  startTime: number;      // minutes from midnight (e.g., 540 = 9:00 AM)[39m                                                                                                                                                  [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m  endTime: number;        // minutes from midnight (e.g., 1020 = 5:00 PM)[39m                                                                                                                                                 [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m  gap?: number;           // minimum gap in minutes between events in same room (default: 15)[39m                                                                                                                             [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m}[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                         [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m```[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                       [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m### Output[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m```typescript[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                             [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231minterface Assignment {[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                    [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m  eventId: string;[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                        [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m  roomId: string;[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                         [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m  startTime: number;      // minutes from midnight[39m                                                                                                                                                                        [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m  endTime: number;        // minutes from midnight[39m                                                                                                                                                                        [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m}[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                         [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231minterface ScheduleResult {[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m  assignments: Assignment[];[39m                                                                                                                                                                                              [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m  unscheduled: string[];  // event IDs that could not be scheduled[39m                                                                                                                                                        [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m}[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                         [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m```[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                       [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m## API[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                    [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mExport a `schedule` function (named export, default export, or via a `Scheduler` class / `createScheduler` factory):[39m                                                                                                      [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m```typescript[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                             [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mfunction schedule(events: Event[], rooms: Room[], options: ScheduleOptions): ScheduleResult;[39m                                                                                                                              [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m```[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                       [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m## Scheduling Rules[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                       [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m1. **Room capacity**: An event's `attendees` count must not exceed the room's `capacity`.[39m                                                                                                                                 [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m2. **Time window**: Every event must start and end within `[options.startTime, options.endTime]`.[39m                                                                                                                         [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m3. **Room gaps**: Events in the same room must have at least `options.gap` minutes between them (end of one event to start of the next). Default gap is 15 minutes.[39m                                                       [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m4. **Prerequisites**: If event B lists event A in its `prerequisites`, then A must finish before B can start. The gap between prerequisite events also applies (A's end time + gap <= B's start time).[39m                    [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m5. **Preferred room**: When an event specifies a `preferredRoom`, honor it if possible without violating other constraints.[39m                                                                                               [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m6. **Prerequisite cycles**: If the prerequisite graph contains a cycle (including self-references), throw an error.[39m                                                                                                       [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m7. **Batch optimization**: Schedule all events at once, maximizing the number of events successfully scheduled. Events that cannot be placed should appear in `unscheduled`.[39m                                              [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m## Behavior[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                               [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- The scheduler should maximize the number of events scheduled. Simply fitting events in order is not sufficient -- the scheduler should consider how placing one event affects the ability to place others.[39m              [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- When events cannot be scheduled due to conflicting constraints, they should be listed in `unscheduled` rather than throwing an error.[39m                                                                                   [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Prerequisite cycles (including self-references like `A -> A`) must throw an error, not silently skip.[39m                                                                                                                   [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m## Commands[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                               [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m```bash[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                   [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mnpm test        # run tests[39m                                                                                                                                                                                               [49m
